<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - LCC Int'l initiated.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - LCC Int'l initiated.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Merrill Lynch said it initiated coverage of LCC International Inc with a near-term accumulate and a long-term buy ratings.</p>
<p>-- further details were not immediately available.</p>
</text>
